<title>POLAND: ELEKTRIM WINS $3.2 MLN YUGOSLAV CONTRACT.</title>
<headline>ELEKTRIM WINS $3.2 MLN YUGOSLAV CONTRACT.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish industrial and trading conglomerate Elektrim SA said in a Wednesday statement that it won a $3.17 million contract to supply the Kosovo power plant and Kolubara mine in the Yugoslav Federation with spare parts.</p>
<p>It said the shipment of spare parts would be concluded in the third quarter of 1997.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
